## Context
Three reviewers: the multi-turn degradation (3 of 4 agents) is confounded by the
specific self-prompting harness — DeepSeek classifier dependency, fixed
ENCOURAGE/VERIFY strings, budget caps, prompt drift, agent self-imposed rules.
State the finding as "this self-prompting multi-turn harness under these budgets
did not improve F1," not a general indictment of agentic/multi-step workflows.
Tracker: 0644. Reviews: openai_student (concern 5), mistral_student (§6),
mistral_grinchy (obj 4).

## Action
- Reword §6 + conclusion to scope the claim to the tested harness and budgets.

